:"a","props":{"href":"/es/tip/20-04"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["04"]},"Durante los primeros 6 meses solo pecho, ni agua; a partir de los 6 meses, alimentación complementaria y sigue con el pecho"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/es/tip/20-05"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["05"]},"Prepare la leche de fórmula con agua a 70 ℃ o más, déjela enfriar antes de darla y tire lo que sobre"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/es/tip/20-06"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["06"]},"Nada de miel antes del año"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/es/tip/20-07"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["07"]},"La inyección de vitamina K del nacimiento hay que ponerla sí o sí"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/es/tip/20-08"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["08"]},"Si un bebé de menos de 3 meses llega a los 38 ℃ de temperatura, directo al hospital, sin observar en casa"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/es/tip/20-09"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["09"]},"Por mucho cansancio o rabia que lleve, nunca sacuda al bebé"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/es/tip/20-10"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["10"]},"Para elegir pañales, fíjese en tres cosas: si le quedan bien al bebé, con qué frecuencia los cambia y si hay informes de inspecciones oficiales sobre ellos"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/es/tip/20-11"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["11"]},"Los artículos grandes, en este orden: pedirlos prestados, comprarlos de segunda mano, comprarlos nuevos; no lo compres todo de una vez"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/es/tip/20-12"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["12"]},"Si el niño tiene eccema grave o alergia al huevo, no evite el cacahuete: introdúzcalo pronto siguiendo las indicaciones del médico, pero jamás le dé cacahuetes enteros"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"aria-current":"page","className":"active","href":"/es/tip/20-13","data-status":"active"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["13"]},"Vigile estas señales de ictericia en el recién nacido: amarillo antes de las 24 horas, que empeora, difícil de despertar o sin tomar leche, heces pálidas — vaya al hospital el mismo día"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/es/tip/20-14"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["14"]},"Si sigues una dieta vegetariana durante el embarazo o la lactancia, suplementa vitamina B12 todos los días; los alimentos complementarios del bebé deben incluir productos animales, y si insistes en una dieta vegana, consulta primero al médico"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-tip-page"},"children":[{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-breadcrumb","aria-label":"Ruta de navegación"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/es/book"},"children":["Libro"]},{"tag":"span","props":{"aria-hidden":"true"},"children":["/"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/es/book/20"},"children":["Capítulo 20"," ·"," ","Cómo cuidar a un recién nacido"]}]},{"tag":"article","props":{"className":"life-entry-card status-unmarked is-standalone","id":"20-13"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-top"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-entry-number"},"children":["13"]},{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-evidence grade-b"},"children":["Evidencia"," ","B"]}]},{"tag":"h1","props":{"lang":"es"},"children":["Vigile estas señales de ictericia en el recién nacido: amarillo antes de las 24 horas, que empeora, difícil de despertar o sin tomar leche, heces pálidas — vaya al hospital el mismo día"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"lang":"es","className":"life-entry-summary"},"children":["Más de cuatro de cada cinco recién nacidos tienen algo de ictericia; la mayoría se resuelve sola. Amarillo antes de las 24 horas de vida, o que empeora, más somnoliento de lo habitual y difícil de despertar, rechaza la comida, flácido o rígido — hospital el mismo día. Heces pálidas o blancas pueden indicar atresia biliar; revise pronto. Bilirrubina muy alta puede dañar el cerebro y dejar discapacidad permanente."]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-impact"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["Coste"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["Consulta y bilirrubina, dentro de unos cientos de yuanes.…"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["Beneficio"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["La guía de la AAP de 2022 indica que «más del 80 % de los recién nacidos tendrán algún grado de ictericia». Bi…"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-actions","aria-label":"Marcar: Vigile estas señales de ictericia en el recién nacido: amarillo antes de las 24 horas, que empeora, difícil de despertar o sin tomar leche, heces pálidas — vaya al hospital el mismo día"},"children":[{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action done","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-check","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M20 6 9 17l-5-5"},"children":[]}]},"Hecho"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action todo","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-list-todo","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"rect","props":{"x":"3","y":"5","width":"6","height":"6","rx":"1"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m3 17 2 2 4-4"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 6h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 12h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 18h8"},"children":[]}]},"Por hacer"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action favorite","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-bookmark","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m19 21-7-4-7 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h10a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v16z"},"children":[]}]},"Guardar"]}," ",{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"social-share-trigger"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-share2 lucide-share-2","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"5","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"6","cy":"12","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"19","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"8.59","x2":"15.42","y1":"13.51","y2":"17.49"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"15.41","x2":"8.59","y1":"6.51","y2":"10.49"},"children":[]}]},"Compartir consejo"]}]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-detail-toggle","aria-expanded":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"10","height":"10","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"currentColor","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-circle","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"10"},"children":[]}]},"Ocultar detalles"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-chevron-down rotated","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m6 9 6 6 6-6"},"children":[]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-details"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Coste"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["Consulta y bilirrubina, dentro de unos cientos de yuanes. Si hace falta fototerapia, suele ser unos dos días en hospital. Cuesta ir cuando el bebé aún parece bien."]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Beneficio"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["La guía de la AAP de 2022 indica que «más del 80 % de los recién nacidos tendrán algún grado de ictericia». Bilirrubina alta puede causar encefalopatía bilirrubínica aguda y kernicterus. La guía define kernicterus como «enfermedad neurológica incapacitante permanente», con parálisis cerebral coreoatetósica, parálisis de la mirada hacia arriba, displasia del esmalte de dientes de leche y pérdida auditiva. «Ictericia en las primeras 24 horas tras el nacimiento» es factor de riesgo de hiperbilirrubinemia grave. Las recomendaciones del NHS para padres tienen dos niveles. Nivel uno: emergencias — ictericia más somnolencia o imposible de despertar, no come, flacidez o rigidez, convulsiones; ictericia antes de 24 horas también aquí. Nivel dos: médico con urgencia — tras 24 horas no mejora o empeora, orina muy oscura, heces color crema pálido. Globalmente se estiman 480 000 recién nacidos en 2010 con enfermedad hemolítica Rh o hiperbilirrubinemia extrema; 24 % murieron y 13 % desarrollaron kernicterus. Entre supervivientes de kernicterus, más del 83 % quedó con una o más secuelas. Heces pálidas pueden ser atresia biliar; la operación de Kasai antes de los 60 días mejora mucho el pronóstico. Desde 2004 Taiwán incluyó tarjetas de color de heces en el manual de salud infantil; cirugía antes de 60 días pasó de 60 % (2004) a 74,3 % (2005). Tras las tarjetas, la mortalidad por atresia biliar bajó de 26,2 % a 15,9 % en un estudio poblacional — antes-después, no ensayo aleatorizado."]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Fuentes originales"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["Kemper AR, Newman TB, Slaughter JL, et al. (2022). Clinical Practice Guideline Revision: Management of Hyperbilirubinemia in the Newborn Infant 35 or More Weeks of Gestation. Pediatrics, 150(3), e2022058859. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1542/peds.2022-058859","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1542/peds.2022-058859"]},"；NHS. Jaundice in babies（2026-03-24 审阅）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.nhs.uk/conditions/jaundice-newborn/","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.nhs.uk/conditions/jaundice-newborn/"]},"；NICE (2010, 2023 修订). Jaundice in newborn babies under 28 days (CG98), 1.2.6、1.7.1. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.nice.org.uk/guidance/cg98/chapter/Recommendations","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.nice.org.uk/guidance/cg98/chapter/Recommendations"]},"；Bhutani VK, Zipursky A, Blencowe H, et al. (2013). Neonatal hyperbilirubinemia and Rhesus disease of the newborn: incidence and impairment estimates for 2010 at regional and global levels. Pediatric Research, 74(Suppl 1), 86-100. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1038/pr.2013.208","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1038/pr.2013.208"]},"；Hsiao CH, Chang MH, Chen HL, et al. (2008). Universal screening for biliary atresia using an infant stool color card in Taiwan. Hepatology, 47(4), 1233-1240. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1002/hep.22182","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1002/hep.22182"]},"；Lee M, Chen SC, Yang HY, et al. (2016). Infant Stool Color Card Screening Helps Reduce the Hospitalization Rate and Mortality of Biliary Atresia: A 14-Year Nationwide Cohort Study in Taiwan. Medicine, 95(12), e3166. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1097/MD.0000000000003166","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1097/MD.0000000000003166"]},"；国家卫生计生委 (2017). 国家基本公共卫生服务规范（第三版），0～6 岁儿童健康管理服务规范. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.nhc.gov.cn/ewebeditor/uploadfile/2017/04/20170417104506514.pdf","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.nhc.gov.cn/ewebeditor/uploadfile/2017/04/20170417104506514.pdf"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1542/peds.2022-058859","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","className":"life-source-link"},"children":["Abrir fuente"," ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"13","height":"13","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-external-link","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M15 3h6v6"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M10 14 21 3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Nota del autor"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-content-reference"},"children":["La fototerapia usa luz especial en la piel para convertir bilirrubina en formas más fáciles de eliminar. No sustituya con sol en casa: la AAP dice que es difícil hacerlo seguro y eficaz y no lo recomienda como tratamiento. No dé agua ni glucosa para «bajar» la ictericia — la guía también lo desaconseja. El tono amarillo a simple vista no estima bien el nivel de bilirrubina. NICE: no solo a ojo; si duda, mida una vez. Mayor riesgo si nació antes de 38 semanas, hermanos con fototerapia o poca lactancia. Seguimiento según norma nacional de salud pública básica: visita domiciliaria en la semana tras el alta; a los 28-30 días en centro de salud comunitario o policlínico rural — ambas revisan ictericia. Si al alta piden control de bilirrubina, acuda en esa fecha. Ictericia en recién nacido a término más de 14 días o en prematuro más de 21: NICE exige bilirrubina conjugada y color de heces. La ictericia sola no retrasa vacunas (apartado 3 de esta sección). Cribado neonatal: sección 27, apartado 13."]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-personal-note"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Mi nota"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button"},"children":["Escribe un recordatorio…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link","href":"/es/tip/20-12"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-left","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M19 12H5"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["Anterior"]},"Si el niño tiene eccema grave o alergia al huevo, no evite el cacahuete: introdúzcalo pronto siguiendo las indicaciones del médico, pero jamás le dé cacahuetes enteros"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link next","href":"/es/tip/20-14"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["Siguiente"]},"Si sigues una dieta vegetariana durante el embarazo o la lactancia, suplementa vitamina B12 todos los días; los alimentos complementarios del bebé deben incluir productos animales, y si insistes en una dieta vegana, consulta primero al médico"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M5 12h14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"section","props":{"className":"life-tip-related"},"children":[{"tag":"h2","props":{},"children":["Más en este tema"]},{"tag":"ul","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/es/tip/20-06"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["Nada de miel antes del año"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["Mientras el niño tenga menos de 1 año, no le dé miel. Cuenta el agua …"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/es/tip/20-07"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["La inyección de vitamina K del nacimiento hay que ponerla sí o sí"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["Las reservas de vitamina K de un recién nacido ya son bajas de por sí…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/es/tip/20-08"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["Si un bebé de menos de 3 meses llega a los 38 ℃ de temperatura, directo al hospital, sin observar en casa"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["Si el niño tiene menos de 3 meses y llega a los 38 ℃ de temperatura, …"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/es/tip/20-09"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["Por mucho cansancio o rabia que lleve, nunca sacuda al bebé"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["La cabeza del bebé ocupa una proporción grande del cuerpo y los múscu…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/es/tip/20-10"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["Para elegir pañales, fíjese en tres cosas: si le quedan bien al bebé, con qué frecuencia los cambia y si hay informes de inspecciones oficiales sobre ellos"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["Ninguna autoridad oficial ha elaborado un ranking de «qué marca es la…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/es/tip/20-11"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["Los artículos grandes, en este orden: pedirlos prestados, comprarlos de segunda mano, comprarlos nuevos; no lo compres todo de una vez"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["Cochecitos, mantas y juguetes duran poco: primero pida prestado, desp…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-text-link","href":"/es/book/20"},"children":["Leer todo el tema: Cómo cuidar a un recién nacido"," ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"15","height":"15","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M5 12h14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"},"children":[]}]}]}]}]}]}]},{"tag":"aside","props":{"className":"life-ad-space life-ad-space-sponsored","data-ad-placement":"ad_footer","data-ad-group":"reading","data-ad-creative":"read_product","data-ad-ready":"false","aria-label":"Publicidad · Comunidad recomendada"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-ad-space-brand"},"children":[{"tag":"img","props":{"src":"/sites/howtolivebetter/images/shengcai/logo.png","width":"565","height":"144","alt":"Logotipo oficial de Shengcai Youshu","decoding":"async"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-ad-space-copy"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"classNa